data.value:
•  Pause — fix the last typed word;
•  Shift + Pause — convert the selected text fragment;
•  Ctrl + Shift + F9 — toggle the case of the selection or last word;
•  Ctrl + Shift + F10 — convert the selection or last word between Russian and transliteration;
•  Ctrl + Shift + Space — enable or disable the application.

All files are in %AppData%\LayoutFixer:
• settings.json — program settings;
• user-dictionary.json — your user dictionary (your words);
• user-replacements.json — your user replacements;
• debug.log — debug log. Off by default; enabled manually in settings and automatically deleted when disabled.
